{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simulates The\u00a0Look\u00a0&amp;\u00a0Feel Of\u00a0Old\u00a0Disk\u00a0Operating\u00a0Systems\u00a0(DOS).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contains\u00a0Many\u00a0Easter\u00a0Eggs,\u00a0Advancements\u00a0And\u00a0An\u00a0Idle-Game\u00a0Points\u00a0System\u00a0(With\u00a0A\u00a0TSR\u00a0Program\u00a0That\u00a0Runs\u00a0When Started With The &quot;Idle&quot; Command).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes\u00a0A\u00a0Full\u00a0Custom\u00a0File-System\u00a0Format (&quot;MabelFS&quot;)\u00a0That\u00a0Reads\u00a0From\u00a0A\u00a0Virtual\u00a0Hard\u00a0Disk\u00a0Image.<br>All Save Data\u00a0Also Lives\u00a0On\u00a0The\u00a0Virtual\u00a0Disk,\u00a0So\u00a0Deleting\u00a0It Resets The Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You Can Also Enable &quot;Hacker Mode&quot; With A Special Command, That Turns The Text Green, And Plays A Music Track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 11 Advancements\u00a0To Unlock,<br>2\u00a0Unique\u00a0Game\u00a0Modes\u00a0(Idle\u00a0Points &amp;\u00a0MabelEdit Text Editor),<br>There's Plenty Of\u00a0Keyboard-Jabbing\u00a0To Enjoy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740120?t=1747766724","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740120?t=1747766724","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740120/c9a8d21e0a747e154c488df6586098e534b024de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747766724","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740120/c9a8d21e0a747e154c488df6586098e534b024de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747766724","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Simulates The\u00a0Look\u00a0&amp;\u00a0Feel Of\u00a0Old\u00a0Disk\u00a0Operating\u00a0Systems\u00a0(DOS).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Contains\u00a0Many\u00a0Easter\u00a0Eggs,\u00a0Advancements\u00a0And\u00a0An\u00a0Idle-Game\u00a0Points\u00a0System\u00a0(With\u00a0A\u00a0TSR\u00a0Program\u00a0That\u00a0Runs\u00a0When Started With The &quot;Idle&quot; Command).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes\u00a0A\u00a0Full\u00a0Custom\u00a0File-System\u00a0Format (&quot;MabelFS&quot;)\u00a0That\u00a0Reads\u00a0From\u00a0A\u00a0Virtual\u00a0Hard\u00a0Disk\u00a0Image.<br>All Save Data\u00a0Also Lives\u00a0On\u00a0The\u00a0Virtual\u00a0Disk,\u00a0So\u00a0Deleting\u00a0It Resets The Game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You Can Also Enable &quot;Hacker Mode&quot; With A Special Command, That Turns The Text Green, And Plays A Music Track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With 11 Advancements\u00a0To Unlock,<br>2\u00a0Unique\u00a0Game\u00a0Modes\u00a0(Idle\u00a0Points &amp;\u00a0MabelEdit Text Editor),<br>There's Plenty Of\u00a0Keyboard-Jabbing\u00a0To Enjoy.</p>","developers":["MabelisYT"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740120/7b5b17cba7193612773c9cd47291acaf64875a82/header.jpg?t=1747766724","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 6.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7600K / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 6.14<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400F / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 128 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1